# Wave W17-Z (Farewell Spring): fare pine — a spring pine in fresh light greens, tiered and open, its highlight lifted clear of the turf, on fare turf (ground baked in). Farewell Spring’s own tree — split from the Vernal Path’s blossom elm behind it by form entire (conifer spring vs flowering lane) and from Route 215’s wet pine ahead by air: still spring air here, rain-slick there.
